{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FAUST DUEL is a roguelike deck-builder built around Blackjack. You play Dr. Faust, who lost his wager and now gambles in Hell with his soul on the line. At every step, balance greed and reason, combine special card faces and trinkets to bend the odds, defeat foes with unique abilities, and rack up <strong>666 chips</strong> to win back your soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Glimpse of Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic deck, earn chips and rewards, then <strong>modify cards</strong> and <strong>buy trinkets</strong> to shape your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with distinct quirks; play your hand and <strong>beat their total without busting</strong> to win the round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No good options? Strike a <strong>Faustian deal</strong>\u2014draw a card and gain power <strong>at the cost of Sin and Punishments</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resist temptation: <strong>defeat all foes to gain Faith</strong> and claim powerful <strong>Blessings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure isn\u2019t the end\u2014learn, unlock, and <strong>sit back down for another run</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 special card faces</strong>\u00a0and <strong>6 card enchantments\u00a0</strong>\u2013 rule-bending mechanics that can reshape how you count, combine, and protect your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/1fb239465729ff3fbd3fa8171d0ff2d8.avif?t=1769583217\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ trinkets</strong> \u2013 unique effects to handle different enemies and table conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/7f36e0b8590f89bd88e2be1a07e3fe63.avif?t=1769583217\" width=576 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 types of random events: various random events such as random cards and card enchantments, to be used wisely.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 +enemies</strong> \u2013 each with its own passives, bans, and play rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/666ee4223d9f1e9b980b19b43fbcbe74.avif?t=1769583217\" width=576 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>22 Blessings &amp; Curses</strong> \u2013 victories grant lasting Blessings; defeat or demonic bargains burden you with Curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/0520188348758bb12b41f88a472d6b73.avif?t=1769583217\" width=576 height=96 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 difficulties + Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 go from approachable to extreme; chase longer streaks in Endless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Challenges</strong> \u2013 curated constraints that force fresh lines of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/800fbaa1b242ac2caeb5ebb2e640d021.avif?t=1769583217\" width=448 height=64 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snappy rounds</strong> and a strong \u201cjust one more hand\u201d loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildcraft \u00d7 probability</strong>: every Hit matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical decisions with <strong>punchy payoffs</strong> at the table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Single-player only. No real-money gambling or online wagering features.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918360?t=1769583217","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918360?t=1769583217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/c00e1d31714ee6de62225c5161862f1fa97d02a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769583217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/c00e1d31714ee6de62225c5161862f1fa97d02a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769583217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FAUST DUEL is a roguelike deck-builder built around Blackjack. You play Dr. Faust, who lost his wager and now gambles in Hell with his soul on the line. At every step, balance greed and reason, combine special card faces and trinkets to bend the odds, defeat foes with unique abilities, and rack up <strong>666 chips</strong> to win back your soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Glimpse of Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic deck, earn chips and rewards, then <strong>modify cards</strong> and <strong>buy trinkets</strong> to shape your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with distinct quirks; play your hand and <strong>beat their total without busting</strong> to win the round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No good options? Strike a <strong>Faustian deal</strong>\u2014draw a card and ga